- Temporary residence incorrectly described as permanent residence.
- Permanent residence incorrectly described as citizenship.
- Work authorization confused with residence authorization.
- Nationality-specific rules incorrectly described as global.
- Residence-specific rules incorrectly generalized.
- Consular jurisdiction restrictions omitted.
- Expired programs shown as active.
- Incorrect family-member rights.
- Incorrect renewal conditions.
- Incorrect financial thresholds.
- Unsupported processing times.
- Unsupported fees.
- Missing statutory exceptions.
- Conflicting official government sources.

